  ""ID"": ""PT-ATM-003"",
  ""Category"": ""Bypassing local security policies"",
  ""Наименование типа уязвимости"": ""User security policy misconfiguration "",
  ""Vulnerability description"": ""The current configuration of user security policies allows the execution of arbitrary commands or running of third-party software in the system."",
  ""Recommendations on how to fix the vulnerability"": ""Restrict user privileges to prevent the execution of arbitrary commands or running of software in the System and gaining control of the OS. When assigning privileges, assign the minimum set of privileges required for this role."",
  ""Vulnerable component"": ""OS"",
  ""Examples of consequences of exploitation"": ""Control over the OS\nArbitrary code execution\nUnauthorized cash withdrawal"",
  ""How to check whether the vulnerability can be exploited"": ""If the use of third-party software is prohibited (see PT-ATM-019) or other local security policies are in effect: verify whether it is possible to run third-party software using built-in Windows utilities (https://lolbas-project.github.io/)."",
  ""Exploitation conditions"": ""-"",
  ""CWE"": ""CWE-284: Improper Access Control""
}",atm_vulnerability
"### INSTRUCTION
How can the ATM vulnerability 'User security policy misconfiguration ' (PT-ATM-003) be fixed?

### INPUT
The current configuration of user security policies allows the execution of arbitrary commands or running of third-party software in the system.

### OUTPUT
Restrict user privileges to prevent the execution of arbitrary commands or running of software in the System and gaining control of the OS. When assigning privileges, assign the minimum set of privileges required for this role.",atm_vulnerability
"### INSTRUCTION
What are the consequences and exploitation conditions for the ATM vulnerability 'User security policy misconfiguration ' (PT-ATM-003)?

### INPUT
