{
  ""ID"": ""PT-ATM-006"",
  ""Category"": """",
  ""Наименование типа уязвимости"": ""Bypassing the BIOS password"",
  ""Vulnerability description"": ""An attacker can extract the BIOS password from the OS or reset it by pressing the reset button to clear the CMOS memory, removing the battery from the motherboard, or by entering the engineer code. As a result, any unauthorized user can access BIOS, change the boot order, and run the OS from an external drive. This way attackers can gain control of the ATM and make an unauthorized withdrawal of funds."",
