"### INSTRUCTION
What are the consequences and exploitation conditions for the ATM vulnerability 'Wrong boot order' (PT-ATM-008)?

### INPUT
The BIOS of the tested ATM has an incorrect device boot sequence. An attacker can boot the OS from a third-party device, gain control over the ATM, and make unauthorized withdrawal of funds.

### OUTPUT
Consequences: Unauthorized cash withdrawal
