"### INSTRUCTION
How can the ATM vulnerability 'No authentication is required to enter the Supervisor mode.' (PT-ATM-017) be fixed?

### INPUT
The tested ATM has no password protection in the Supervisor mode. This configuration flaw allows unauthorized changes to the ATM settings; in particular, disabling of the MAC signature. By disabling message signing, an attacker can spoof software commands to the dispenser and later perform an unauthorized cash withdrawal.

### OUTPUT
Set a strong password for accessing the Supervisor mode.",atm_vulnerability
