"### INSTRUCTION
How can the ATM vulnerability 'Insufficient firewalling' (PT-ATM-412) be fixed?

### INPUT
Many network services are available on the ATM, which is a sign of insufficient firewalling or a lack of a firewall. The large number of ports open for connection allows an attacker to carry out various attacks on the ATM.

### OUTPUT
Configure the firewall in a way to allow remote connection only to the services required for the ATM to operate. Ports to which access is not required must not be open for remote connection. Allow remote connection to open ports only from certain administrator addresses.",atm_vulnerability
