"### INSTRUCTION
This code loads a JSON fixture file, extracts properties from it, creates Property objects from the properties, and saves them to the database. To use this code, you need to create a JSON fixture file with a ""properties"" key containing a list of property objects. Then, run the code with the appropriate command line arguments to specify the fixture file and folder. The saved objects will be printed to the console.

