REM_BLOCK
Defining a comment block is simple! Start the comment with REM_BLOCK and end the comment
with END_REM ; everything in between will be considered a comment without the need to prepend
every new line with REM . Comment blocks can be especially useful when you have multiple lines
to be included in a single comment or want to retain formatting.
